WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.888 --> 00:00:19.322
"Hi, Winnie called to Gaby and Mog.

2
00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:21.644
They looked up in surprise.

3
00:00:25.907 --> 00:00:26.528
Gaby said.

4
00:00:26.548 --> 00:00:28.729
"Did you guys track the treasure here too?"

5
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.791
Waldo smiled at her.

6
00:00:30.811 --> 00:00:37.768
"Yep." "We followed some clues in an old painting at the Monsterville Historical Society," Gaby said.

7
00:00:38.929 --> 00:00:40.590
Then she gestured at the old tree.

8
00:00:44.514 --> 00:00:45.675
was a tree in the painting.

9
00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:47.856
We think it might be this one."

10
00:00:47.876 --> 00:00:52.460
"It's grown a lot since Pedro buried the treasure," Mog said.

11
00:00:53.321 --> 00:00:55.142
Winnie held up the gold compass.

12
00:00:55.823 --> 00:00:58.725
"We found Pedro's old compass and put a spell on it.

13
00:00:59.146 --> 00:01:01.628
I guess it worked just as well as detective work."

14
00:01:03.052 --> 00:01:04.513
"Which means everybody is a winner!"

15
00:01:04.874 --> 00:01:05.754
Ben said brightly.

16
00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:08.196
"So you guys don't have to compete anymore.

17
00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:09.938
We're all on the same team now."

18
00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:14.442
"That was so much fun," Mog said.

19
00:01:14.462 --> 00:01:18.845
"We still need to find the treasure," Winnie reminded everyone.

20
00:01:18.865 --> 00:01:23.169
"All we know is that it's buried near this tree," Gaby said.

21
00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.191
She glanced at the school building.

22
00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:30.996
it's even buried under the school building."

23
00:01:33.212 --> 00:01:35.654
"That's what we were thinking too," Waldo said.

24
00:01:35.674 --> 00:01:38.976
"We can try using the compass to track the exact spot."

25
00:01:38.996 --> 00:01:42.858
"First we'd better find a shovel," Mog said.

26
00:01:42.878 --> 00:01:45.720
"Let's see if there are any shovels in the equipment shed."

27
00:01:50.162 --> 00:01:53.384
The kids found one shovel in a shed near the soccer field.

28
00:01:54.365 --> 00:01:58.948
When they headed back to the front of the school building, the main doors suddenly flew open.

29
00:01:59.696 --> 00:02:03.258
Mr. Freaky, Mayor Hubbletree, and Pirate Pedro came out.

30
00:02:04.098 --> 00:02:08.921
As the grown-ups talked to one another, none of them noticed the students standing near the tree.

31
00:02:08.941 --> 00:02:14.723
"I think they're talking about Monster Academy," Winnie whispered.

32
00:02:16.424 --> 00:02:18.665
Ben stepped closer so he could eavesdrop.

33
00:02:18.685 --> 00:02:23.608
"Thank you for meeting with us tonight, Pedro," Mayor Hubbletree was saying.

34
00:02:24.772 --> 00:02:29.516
"Obviously this is an emergency situation involving Freaky's poor school."

35
00:02:29.536 --> 00:02:32.958
"You're welcome, mate," the pirate said.

36
00:02:32.978 --> 00:02:35.560
"I'm glad to help, if I can."

37
00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.662
"Thank you, Pedro.

38
00:02:37.982 --> 00:02:42.025
I'm sure your fundraising will save Monster Academy," Mr.

39
00:02:42.065 --> 00:02:42.725
Freaky said.

40
00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:46.248
"Your Career Day talk was so inspiring.

41
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:50.391
Lots of citizens of Monsterville—" "And People Place!"

42
00:02:50.771 --> 00:02:51.572
The mayor cut in.

43
00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:57.378
"Both monsters and humans will enjoy hearing your pirate tales," Mr.

44
00:02:57.418 --> 00:02:58.219
Freaky went on.

45
00:02:58.239 --> 00:03:06.022
"Pirating is such an exciting job—it's almost as thrilling as being the principal of Monster Academy."

46
00:03:09.424 --> 00:03:14.766
Just then a breeze blew, and boards flew off some windows on the second floor of the school.

47
00:03:14.786 --> 00:03:18.568
"Indeed!" Mayor Hubbletree declared.

48
00:03:19.116 --> 00:03:23.340
"Pedro, your fundraising talks will be an enormous success.

49
00:03:23.721 --> 00:03:26.203
Hundreds of people—" "And monsters!"

50
00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:27.604
Mr. Freaky said.

51
00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:30.767
"Will happily attend," the mayor went on.

52
00:03:30.787 --> 00:03:35.852
"And most importantly they'll pay good money to hear your tales.

53
00:03:36.493 --> 00:03:40.697
The funds you raise might even be enough to repair Freaky's school."

54
00:03:48.856 --> 00:03:51.377
He shook his head as the flagpole snapped in two.

55
00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:55.039
"I don't know how you monsters put up with this place.

56
00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.901
Everything is falling apart, Freaky."

57
00:03:58.942 --> 00:04:01.923
Mr. Freaky took out his handkerchief and blew his noses.

58
00:04:07.946 --> 00:04:12.069
this budget crisis, we've gotten a bit behind on repairs.

59
00:04:12.649 --> 00:04:15.030
But everything is totally under control at Monster Academy."

60
00:04:16.511 --> 00:04:18.092
"Hmpf," the mayor grunted.

61
00:04:18.672 --> 00:04:20.673
"I'm not so sure about that."

62
00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:24.876
"Well, I'm happy to help," Pedro repeated.

63
00:04:24.896 --> 00:04:27.898
"Talking to the students was great fun.

64
00:04:28.458 --> 00:04:31.700
It reminded me of the good old days with my band of pirates."

65
00:04:33.301 --> 00:04:33.901
He sighed.

66
00:04:33.921 --> 00:04:37.583
"We'd all sail the seas together for months.

67
00:04:38.364 --> 00:04:44.828
Why, this one time, when we met Awful Ollie the Orange Pedro launched into another pirating tale.

68
00:04:46.224 --> 00:04:47.905
After a few minutes, Mr.

69
00:04:47.945 --> 00:04:49.805
Freaky and the mayor looked a little bored.

70
00:04:50.965 --> 00:04:53.146
But Ben saw that Mog's eyes were glowing.

71
00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:57.627
"Pedro is so lucky," Mog whispered.

72
00:04:57.647 --> 00:04:59.928
"Being a pirate sounds awesome."

73
00:04:59.948 --> 00:05:05.149
"Ollie and his men had no idea what we were plotting," Pedro went on.

74
00:05:05.169 --> 00:05:10.131
"They were just passing the time on the deck of their ship, singing and playing their instruments.

75
00:05:11.031 --> 00:05:16.862
That's when we jumped aboard with our swords and cried—" "Shiver me timbers!"

76
00:05:17.262 --> 00:05:18.603
Mog blurted out loudly.

77
00:05:18.623 --> 00:05:20.324
"What was that?"

78
00:05:20.865 --> 00:05:24.248
Mr. Freaky gasped, and spun toward Ben and the others.

79
00:05:24.268 --> 00:05:28.151
"What are you students doing here?"

80
00:05:29.272 --> 00:05:31.834
Mayor Hubbletree squinted at them through the darkness.

81
00:05:31.854 --> 00:05:34.856
"It's very late, Freaky.

82
00:05:35.336 --> 00:05:37.398
Shouldn't those monsters be home in bed?"

83
00:05:37.418 --> 00:05:44.364
"We're uh, searching for Pedro's treasure," Waldo said.

84
00:05:45.524 --> 00:05:46.745
The adults chuckled.

85
00:05:46.765 --> 00:05:52.028
"How nice," Mayor Hubbletree said.

86
00:05:53.388 --> 00:05:55.609
The mayor came over and patted Mog's head.

87
00:05:55.629 --> 00:05:57.550
"Treasure hunting!

88
00:05:58.211 --> 00:06:03.554
That sounds like a fun activity, kids er, I mean, monsters."

89
00:06:05.335 --> 00:06:06.335
Winnie looked annoyed.

90
00:06:06.355 --> 00:06:10.357
"We're not playing treasure hunting," she said.

91
00:06:10.377 --> 00:06:12.078
"This is for real."

92
00:06:12.098 --> 00:06:15.220
"Yeah," Mog said, rubbing his head.

93
00:06:16.416 --> 00:06:19.078
"We've actually found Pedro's lost treasure.

94
00:06:19.719 --> 00:06:21.340
And guess where it's buried."

95
00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.742
"Where?" said Mr.

96
00:06:24.822 --> 00:06:27.404
Freaky, Mayor Hubbletree, and Pedro all at once.

97
00:06:28.465 --> 00:06:29.346
Mog grinned.

98
00:06:29.366 --> 00:06:32.348
"Here at Monster Academy!"
